<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' 10-mth budget surplus 6.85 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippines' 10-mth budget surplus 6.85 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines posted a budget surplus of 6.85 billion pesos in the first ten months of the year, lower than 10.9 billion pesos registered in the same period last year, the Bureau of Treasury said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The actual surplus was higher than the programmed 4.865 billion pesos set for the end of October.  </p>
<p>    FISCAL POSITION   Jan-Oct 96  Jan-Sept 96  Jan-Oct 95</p>
<p>    Revenues	     341.379     303.413	302.6</p>
<p>    Expenditures	 334.529     295.923	291.7</p>
<p>    Surplus		  6.850	 7.490	 10.9</p>
<p>Note: The figures are in billion pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
